# What the repo does NOT carry.
# Written 2026-07-24. The rule: code, laws, plans and notes belong in git.
# Databases, backups, media and machine litter do not.

# --- databases: the book and the ruling layer live in ~/Archive, never here
# *.db allowed as of 2026-08-05, Saba's word ("at least for now") — the real
# Sermons.db / Archive_Suggestions.db still live outside this repo in ~/Archive;
# nothing here pulls them in automatically. Revisit this ruling later.
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3

# --- backups of any kind
backups/
_backups/
*.bak
*_before_*.py
*_before_*.db

# --- media: it lives on the Data drive
*.mp4
*.webm
*.mp3
*.m4a
*.wav
*.aiff
*.mov

# --- voiceprints and faces (they belong beside the archive, not in code)
voiceprints/
faces/

# --- machine litter
.DS_Store
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
.venv/
venv/

# --- Xcode's per-user state, not the project
xcuserdata/
*.xcuserstate

# --- session and worktree scratch
.claude/

# the exclusion ledger — never travels
exclusions.json
*exclusions*.json
